# Stackra file contract:
# Purpose: the ignore rules of this service member: generated output stays out of git except the
#          contract artefacts other members build their clients from (app-manifest.json) and the
#          OpenAPI projection. Same rule set as the root .gitignore, repeated so the member folder
#          keeps it when copied elsewhere.
# Boundary: ignore rules only.
# Runtime: node
# Governing contract: ADR 0158 decision 1 (the manifest and its OpenAPI projection are committed)

# everything `stackra gen` writes under .stackra/ (the Encore app included) is rebuilt from source
.stackra/*
# the committed contract other members build their clients from
!.stackra/app-manifest.json
# its OpenAPI projection, committed beside it
!.stackra/openapi.json
# template only: the generated samples are committed so they can be read; a real project drops
# this line once `stackra gen` runs in it
!.stackra/**
